# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A Turborepo + pnpm-workspaces monorepo, scaffolded by `create-korzu-app`.

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev      # runs `dev` in every app, via Turborepo
pnpm build    # builds every app + package, in dependency order
```

Each app under `apps/*` is a complete project on its own — see its own `README.md`/`CLAUDE.md`
for how to work on it specifically. Shared code lives under `packages/*`.
